{"id":"57a5cf227ab79e59","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-plain-symmetry.md","title":"Plain Symmetry of Information","display":"thm-plain-symmetry — Plain Symmetry of Information","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-plain-symmetry","aliases":["43-thm-plain-symmetry"],"display":"thm-plain-symmetry — Plain Symmetry of Information","depends_on":["[[43-df-kolm]]","[[43-df-condplainkolm]]","[[43-df-pair-coding]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 6.3.2","source_printed_pages":"92–93","source_pdf_pages":"112–113","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-plain-symmetry"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-plain-symmetry</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-plain-symmetry — Plain Symmetry of Information"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 6.3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"92–93"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"112–113"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\">\\(C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\)</span>、配对见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left|C(\\sigma,\\tau)-C(\\sigma)-C(\\tau\\mid\\sigma)\\right|\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(C(\\sigma,\\tau)+2)\\rceil.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left|C(\\sigma,\\tau)-C(\\sigma)-C(\\tau\\mid\\sigma)\\right|\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(C(\\sigma,\\tau)+2)\\rceil.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书中对数误差以显式整数常数界展开；加 2 覆盖复杂度为 0 或 1 的边界，常数对两字符串统一。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 6.3.2；印刷页 92–93，PDF 页 112–113。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-condplainkolm","status":"resolved","id":"e79ea45002ccf795","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-condplainkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pair-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C$、$C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$、配对见 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-condplainkolm]]、[[43-df-pair-coding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-condplainkolm","status":"resolved","id":"e79ea45002ccf795","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C$、$C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$、配对见 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-condplainkolm]]、[[43-df-pair-coding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C$、$C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$、配对见 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-condplainkolm]]、[[43-df-pair-coding]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left|C(\\sigma,\\tau)-C(\\sigma)-C(\\tau\\mid\\sigma)\\right|\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(C(\\sigma,\\tau)+2)\\rceil.","display":true}],"bytes":1334,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-plain-symmetry]] — Plain Symmetry of Information"}],"outgoing":["a0589ee7a1cc12e8","e79ea45002ccf795","e039afac1517f3d7"]}